 "words": 203,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The day of Pentecost had finally come",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They were all together in one place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Waiting for the promise to be fulfilled",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the quiet of that gathered space",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Suddenly a sound came from the sky",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like a rushing, violent wind",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It filled the whole house where they sat",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the air began to spin",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Tongues as of fire appeared and divided",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Coming to rest on each of them",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Filled with the Holy Spirit completely",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Speaking in other tongues again",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Devout Jews from every nation",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Living in Jerusalem now",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the sound was heard by the crowd",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They gathered in a bewildered hour",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Each one heard them speaking clearly",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In his own language, strange and true",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Tongues as of fire appeared and divided",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Coming to rest on each of them",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Filled with the Holy Spirit completely",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Speaking in other tongues again",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They were astounded and amazed",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saying look at these speakers here",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Are not all these Galileans",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who stand before us with such fear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Tongues as of fire appeared and divided",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Coming to rest on each of them",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Filled with the Holy Spirit completely",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Speaking in other tongues again",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
